## T-396 — PROJ_RIVE-GO_CODE_V5_COMPLETE
Date: 2026-05-10
Commit: d76225a

### Root cause confirmed
Rive @rive-app/canvas v2 renders artboard children in REVERSE stream order
(first-emitted = rendered in FRONT). Browser tests of T-395 experiments proved it.

### Fix applied
`rive/builder/builder.go` — `ArtboardBuilder.emit()`: loop `ab.children` in
reverse so first-declared child is last-emitted → rendered at back.
ShapeRef.shapeIdx set during emitObjects() so animation indices self-correct.

### Files changed
- `rive/builder/builder.go` — core fix
- `docs/preview/fromjson/autumn_leaves.json` — restored gradient sky (commit 8121298)
- `docs/preview/fromjson_autumn.riv` — rebuilt (1115 bytes), object order: leaf5→leaf4→leaf3→leaf2→leaf1→sky
- `docs/preview/fromjson_dots.riv`, `fromjson_easing.riv` — rebuilt (structurally consistent)
- Deleted: mixed_bg_test, autumn_sky_last, ellipse_test (.json + .riv)
- `docs/preview/index.html` — removed 3 diagnostic cards, count updated to six

### All tests pass
GOTMPDIR workaround required (/tmp is noexec in this container).

